# Gravel path (the cycle path on the old Ischlerbahn trackbed, the Kaiserpark
# avenues): pale i gravel with grey m pebbles (d shadow pixel) and warm o/O
# pebbles; an open top gets a light i lip (the walkable surface) over a
# darker m edge line. Open left/right: a rounded gravel shoulder (lit m/i
# left, d right); open bottom: a d base line. No roots, no G (forest_path),
# no cobbles (ground). No k (static solid tile).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids are the source.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_kies
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
